@PetCare.API_HostAddress = https://localhost:7196
@HttpHost = http://localhost:5078

### Obtener todos los clientes
GET {{HttpHost}}/api/customers
Accept: application/json

###

### 1. Crear un Cliente (Customer)
# @name createCustomer
POST {{HttpHost}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Juan",
  "lastName": "Pérez",
  "email": "juan.perez@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": "+59170012345",
  "address": "Av. Busch, Santa Cruz"
}

###

### 2. Agregar una Mascota (Pet) al Cliente creado
# Pega el ID del cliente devuelto en la petición anterior donde dice {customerId}
@customerId = REEMPLAZA_CON_ID_DEL_CLIENTE

POST {{HttpHost}}/api/customers/{{customerId}}/pets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Firulais",
  "species": "Dog",
  "breed": "Golden Retriever",
  "weightKg": 25.5,
  "specialRequirements": "Ninguno",
  "hasVaccinationRecord": true
}

###

### 3. Crear un Proveedor (Provider)
# @name createProvider
POST {{HttpHost}}/api/providers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pet Paradise Grooming",
  "serviceTypes": "Grooming, Vet",
  "serviceArea": "Santa Cruz de la Sierra",
  "maxDailyCapacity": 10,
  "isActive": true
}

###

### 4. Crear una Reserva (Booking)
# Reemplaza los GUIDs con los IDs reales obtenidos en los pasos 1, 2 y 3.
@petId = REEMPLAZA_CON_ID_DE_LA_MASCOTA
@providerId = REEMPLAZA_CON_ID_DEL_PROVEEDOR

POST {{HttpHost}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "petId": "{{petId}}",
  "providerId": "{{providerId}}",
  "serviceType": "Grooming",
  "modality": "HomeVisit",
  "scheduledTime": "2026-08-10T10:00:00Z",
  "status": "Pending",
  "totalCost": 150.00
}

###

### 5. Confirmar Reserva (Dispara Evento BookingConfirmedEvent -> consumido por Billing)
# Reemplaza el GUID con el ID de la reserva obtenida en el paso 4
@bookingId = REEMPLAZA_CON_ID_DE_LA_RESERVA

POST {{HttpHost}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 6. Actualizar Estado del Servicio (Dispara Evento ServiceStatusUpdatedEvent -> consumido por Booking)
# El Proveedor actualiza el estado de la reserva (ej. Completed)
POST {{HttpHost}}/api/providers/update-booking-status?bookingId={{bookingId}}&newStatus=Completed
Content-Type: application/json

###
